From d2c8bb078a1d01f1bc9d57e29652284e519e4265 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 02:25:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Nintendo Switch homebrew (.nro) proof of concept: libnx glue,
 Makefile.switch, __SWITCH__ paths

- src/switch_platform.[ch]: libnx glue (base dir from argv[0], SDL pad mapping, on-screen confirm, nxlink)
- Makefile.switch: devkitA64 + switch-sdl2 build, nro/nacp/icon
- main.c: POSIX ROM search, early window/renderer + on-screen messages, fixed-screen handling
- BBL_FIXED_SCREEN (shared with Android) hides display-mode/monitor/size options
- Switch defaults: sharp-bilinear scaling, pre-scale capped at 2x; bg thread explicit stack
